PART 7: COMMON JSX MISTAKES

================================================================================

Mistake 1: Using class Instead of className

Wrong:

<div class="container">
  <h1>Title</h1>
</div>


Correct:

<div className="container">
  <h1>Title</h1>
</div>


================================================================================

Mistake 2: Forgetting Curly Braces

================================================================================

Wrong:

const name = 'Alice';

<h1>Hello name</h1>


Output:

Hello name


Correct:

const name = 'Alice';

<h1>Hello {name}</h1>


Output:

Hello Alice


================================================================================

Mistake 3: Multiple Adjacent Root Elements

================================================================================

Wrong:

return (
  <h1>Title</h1>
  <p>Paragraph</p>
);


Correct:

return (
  <>

    <h1>Title</h1>

    <p>Paragraph</p>

  </>
);


================================================================================

Mistake 4: Missing key in Lists

================================================================================

Wrong:

{items.map(item => (
  <li>
    {item.name}
  </li>
))}


Correct:

{items.map(item => (
  <li key={item.id}>
    {item.name}
  </li>
))}

Why key Matters

key helps React identify corresponding list items between renders.

Prefer a stable ID from your data:

key={item.id}


rather than an array index when list items can be inserted, removed, or reordered.

================================================================================

Mistake 5: Incorrect Inline Style Syntax

================================================================================

Wrong:

<div style="color: red; font-size: 16px">
  Text
</div>


Correct:

<div
  style={{
    color: 'red',
    fontSize: '16px'
  }}
>
  Text
</div>

Understanding {{ }}
Outer { }    | JavaScript expression in JSX
Inner { }    | JavaScript object
fontSize     | camelCase CSS property
'16px'       | CSS value


================================================================================

COMMON MISTAKES - QUICK TABLE

================================================================================

Mistake               | Wrong                  | Correct
----------------------|------------------------|--------------------------
CSS class             | class="btn"            | className="btn"
Variable              | Hello name             | Hello {name}
Multiple roots        | <h1/><p/>              | <><h1/><p/></>
Self-closing element  | <img>                  | <img />
Event handler         | onclick=...            | onClick={...}
Label attribute       | for="name"             | htmlFor="name"
List item             | <li>                   | <li key={item.id}>
CSS property          | font-size              | fontSize
Inline style          | style="color:red"      | style={{ color: 'red' }}


